Well, yes, but they're incredibly
rare and grow in hard-to-reach places.

107
00:06:16,460 --> 00:06:20,277
The ceremony really follows the
legend down to the last detail, huh?

108
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,242
That's amazing.

109
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:25,017
Personally, I don't think Poesia
Moor is a very good story.

110
00:06:25,100 --> 00:06:26,457
