them to fight over her.

114
00:06:35,660 --> 00:06:37,954
Pretty villainous of her if you ask me.

115
00:06:38,340 --> 00:06:39,577
That's an unfair assessment.

116
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:42,640
See, I think she simply couldn't decide.

117
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:48,260
When you truly fall in love, it
must be an overwhelming experience,

118
00:06:48,580 --> 00:06:53,000
making it difficult for even you
yourself to discern how you really feel.

119
00:06:54,620 --> 00:06:57,177
Well, maybe that's how
it works for some people.

120
00:06:57,260 --> 00:06:59,720
You know what they say, love is blind.

121
00:06:59,980 --> 00:07:03,057
Yeah, but I don't think
that's quite what they meant.

122
00:07:03,140 --> 00:07:05,787
