126
00:07:16,260 --> 00:07:18,848
On the contrary, I very
much think there is.

127
00:07:23,260 --> 00:07:24,660
Well, we should go now.

128
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:27,428
I'm sure that we'll see
you around sometime.

129
00:07:29,220 --> 00:07:30,697
Well, that was rather strange.

130
00:07:30,780 --> 00:07:31,610
What?

131
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,800
Peppy and Loretta?

132
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:35,260
No, I meant the commoner.

133
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:38,031
Her behavior has been questionable lately.

134
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:41,760
Oh, you observe Ray
pretty closely, don't you?

135
00:07:42,100 --> 00:07:43,220
Of course I do.

136
00:07:43,620 --> 00:07:46,679
I wouldn't be a very
responsible master if I didn't.

137
00:07:47,620 --> 00:07:48,450
Hmm.

138
00:07:48,533 --> 00:07:50,687
And yet you don't know
what's wrong with her.

139
00:07:52,100 --> 00:07:52,930
Right.

140
00:07:53,013 --> 00:07:53,977
What was it you said before?

141
00:07:54,060 --> 00:07:55,500
About love being blind?

142
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:58,440
Sorry, what was that? Hmm?

143
00:08:00,300 --> 00:08:02,160
Oh, it's nothing, really.

144
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:12,817
We need to have a word with you!

145
00:08:12,900 --> 00:08:14,577
Oh, hey there, Minibus Squadron.

146
00:08:14,660 --> 00:08:16,457
Sorry I can't remember your real name.

147
00:08:16,540 --> 00:08:20,157
Not only are you the most insulent
commoner ever, you're also quite stupid!

148
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:24,137
I apologize, there's only enough room
in my brain for Miss Claire's wishes.

149
00:08:24,220 --> 00:08:25,737
So, uh, what do you want from me?

150
00:08:25,820 --> 00:08:29,408
Frankly, I can't comprehend half
of the things you say or do.

151
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,057
But, um...

152
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:34,917
We wanted to ask if you're being honest
about your feelings for Miss Claire.

153
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:35,830
Are you?

154
00:08:36,780 --> 00:08:40,377
Look, no matter what happens, you must
promise you'll protect Miss Claire.

155
00:08:40,460 --> 00:08:44,277
You're her personal maid, so can you
guard her from morning until night?

156
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,677
Even if you have to go up against royalty?

157
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:47,590
What royalty?

158
00:08:47,900 --> 00:08:50,277
Hold on, are you talking
about Princess Manaria?

159
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,007
Hush, don't speak so loudly.

160
00:08:52,340 --> 00:08:53,400
Okie dokie, then.

161
00:08:53,500 --> 00:08:55,206
I'm gonna take that as a yes.

162
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:58,280
We heard that Princess Manaria has, um,

163
00:08:58,580 --> 00:09:02,637
let's say, a track record among the
ladies of the night in her kingdom.

164
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,550
Rumor's right.

165
00:09:03,633 --> 00:09:05,519
People spread the strangest things.

166
00:09:06,860 --> 00:09:09,357
But regardless, if anything
happens to Miss Claire,

167
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:11,499
know that we'll be looking for you.

168
00:09:14,060 --> 00:09:18,980
Loretta, I can't help but wonder if we
asked the wrong person to help us with this.

169
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,137
Please don't say that.

170
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:22,338
I simply can't process it right now.

171
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,677
Well, good night, Miss Clare.

172
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:28,113
See you in the morning.

173
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,940
I admire your patience, Ray.

174
00:09:32,940 --> 00:09:34,646
Do you have a moment to talk?

175
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:40,689
You're in love with
Miss Clare, aren't you?

176
00:09:41,100 --> 00:09:45,840
Yet you've been awfully well-behaved
lately, even after all my provocations.

177
00:09:46,780 --> 00:09:47,780
So it's true.

178
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,845
You were trying to provoke me.

179
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:52,019
I do love Miss Clare, you're right.

180
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:55,793
That said, I've never expected
her to return my feelings.

181
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:59,000
The only thing that matters
to me is her happiness.

182
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:02,760
Is that so?

183
00:10:03,020 --> 00:10:05,997
I didn't realize your feelings
for her were so shallow.

184
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,040
I'm unfortunate.

185
00:10:07,380 --> 00:10:08,277
I beg your pardon?

186
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:11,097
What do you mean my feelings
for her are shallow?

187
00:10:11,180 --> 00:10:12,240
Figure of speech.

188
00:10:12,540 --> 00:10:13,577
Did I hit a nerve?

189
00:10:13,660 --> 00:10:14,600
My apologies.

190
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:16,257
With all due respect,

191
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:19,957
the way I feel for Miss Claire is
something you could never comprehend.

192
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:21,817
And yet you're giving up on her.

193
00:10:21,900 --> 00:10:23,429
I am not giving up on her.

194
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:26,537
I already told you I'm
putting her happiness first.

195
00:10:26,620 --> 00:10:28,149
No, you're being a coward.

196
00:10:28,540 --> 00:10:33,337
If you had a spine, you would fight to make
her happier than anyone else ever could.

197
00:10:33,420 --> 00:10:34,357
That's not...

198
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:39,300
I'd do anything to make Miss Claire
happy for as long as she'd let me.

199
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:43,900
But I'm a commoner, and we're both girls.

200
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:46,974
That's not what she wants in a partner.

201
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:50,440
So I'd never make her as
happy as she deserves to be.

202
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:53,980
You shouldn't run.

203
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:55,221
I'm not running.

204
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,550
Really?

205
00:10:56,633 --> 00:10:58,440
Then try to take her back from me.

206
00:10:58,700 --> 00:11:00,937
It sounds like you're
trying to pick a fight.

207
00:11:01,020 --> 00:11:01,850
I am.

208
00:11:02,180 --> 00:11:04,040
Did you just figure that out?

209
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:09,257
You're just as weak as your love for Claire
is, and I'm going to make you face it.

210
00:11:09,340 --> 00:11:10,281
You'll thank me.

211
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:12,245
I'm doing you both a kindness.

212
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:15,096
All right, Princess.

213
00:11:15,380 --> 00:11:17,556
If you want to fight, you've got one!

214
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:19,110
Good.

215
00:11:19,193 --> 00:11:20,785
That's what I hoped you'd say.

216
00:11:21,060 --> 00:11:25,500
Well then, meet me after school
tomorrow at the Magic Practice Ground.

217
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,440
And don't run away.

218
00:11:36,740 --> 00:11:40,300
My love isn't weak, and
I'll prove it to you!

219
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:45,997
She's going up against
Ray Taylor this time?

220
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,237
This ought to be good.

221
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,377
Who do you think will win?

222
00:11:48,460 --> 00:11:50,580
Sister, I don't understand.

223
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:52,677
What made you decide to
go through with this?

224
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:54,819
It's just a friendly test of skill.

225
00:11:54,940 --> 00:11:56,940
