226
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,435
Took you long enough.

227
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:00,500
You've got spirit.

228
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:02,136
That's good to know.

229
00:12:02,980 --> 00:12:04,060
Well, let's begin.

230
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:06,260
Are you both ready? Ready.

231
