236
00:12:26,780 --> 00:12:28,180
Not a bad opener.

237
00:12:28,460 --> 00:12:31,617
But you still don't have what
it takes to win against me.

238
00:12:31,700 --> 00:12:32,530
You sure?

239
00:12:32,613 --> 00:12:34,009
You might want to look up.

240
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,600
Water Meteor!

241
00:12:43,780 --> 00:12:44,760
Sister, no!

242
00:12:44,980 --> 00:12:46,980
A fusion of earth and water magic.

243
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:49,137
That's some pretty insane power she has.

244
00:12:49,220 --> 00:12:50,985
Even Manaria is having trouble.

245
00:12:51,220 --> 00:12:52,660
I'm not so sure.

246
00:12:53,220 --> 00:12:54,120
How rude.

247
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:57,400
You got my clothes all wet.

248
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:02,980
An exceptional level wind spell.

249
00:13:03,520 --> 00:13:04,350
Teleport.

250
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:09,717
The way that played out, I'd say she must
have had some idea of what was coming.

251
00:13:09,800 --> 00:13:11,197
But it's still tough to deflect.

252
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:12,420
I'm insulted.

253
00:13:12,660 --> 00:13:15,957
This better not mean that she was
holding back against me during our duel.

254
00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:18,597
You're going all in right
from the start, huh?

255
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:23,137
Well, I don't exactly have much of a choice
when I'm up against someone like you.

256
00:13:23,220 --> 00:13:25,455
Princess Manaria can use Spellbreaker.

257
00:13:25,740 --> 00:13:30,660
If the battle drags out, she'll
analyze all my spells and erase them.

258
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,860
I'm not taking that chance.

259
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,077
What's the matter?

260
00:13:34,160 --> 00:13:36,397
You're not about to call
it quits now, are you?

261
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,310
Yeah, right!

262
00:13:37,393 --> 00:13:38,260
In your dreams!

263
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:53,017
This move is a high-level
spell that players

264
00:13:53,100 --> 00:13:55,747
normally can't use until
the end of the game.

265
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:56,960
Chain spell.

266
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,180
Code, hide it!

267
00:13:59,740 --> 00:14:02,677
It's the highest level of
attack I have right now.

268
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:03,819
This should do it.

269
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:06,200
Well done.

270
00:14:06,660 --> 00:14:08,200
That was very close.

271
00:14:13,880 --> 00:14:16,277
If it was anyone else you were up against,

272
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:18,617
you probably would have
just won the match.

273
00:14:18,700 --> 00:14:20,920
How did you manage to dodge all that?

274
00:14:22,580 --> 00:14:23,980
I'm not telling.

275
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:25,781
Teleport, maybe?

276
00:14:26,060 --> 00:14:28,037
No, there wasn't quite enough time.

277
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:30,757
Reaction speeds off the
charts like everything else.

278
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,193
Tell me something, Ray.

279
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:34,673
Don't you think that was a bit too much?

280
00:14:34,980 --> 00:14:38,040
Even if we are under a
magic dampening barrier,

281
00:14:38,380 --> 00:14:42,397
if that had hit me directly, I would
have been more than just a bit injured.

282
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:45,245
And yet you evaded it
without breaking a sweat.

283
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:47,660
Well, consider who you're battling.

284
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:53,777
Since you managed to give me such an
entertaining show, maybe I'll return the favor.

285
00:14:53,860 --> 00:14:56,060
Oh no, I know what's coming.

286
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:58,297
I'll have to use Kokaitis again.

287
00:14:58,380 --> 00:15:00,140
No, that won't work.

288
00:15:00,580 --> 00:15:01,660
What do I do?

289
00:15:01,940 --> 00:15:03,764
I have nothing to counter with.

290
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:05,560
You're finished!

291
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,080
Dominator.

292
00:15:28,220 --> 00:15:31,457
Dominator, a spell that
uses all four attributes.

293
00:15:31,540 --> 00:15:36,220
It takes control of the victim's
magic and makes it go berserk.

294
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:39,120
It's the most brutal
attack spell there is.

295
00:15:39,540 --> 00:15:43,320
And against another spellcaster,
the ultimate weapon.

296
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:08,990
Commoner!

297
00:16:09,073 --> 00:16:10,320
Are you all right?

298
00:16:10,860 --> 00:16:12,720
No! Wake up!

299
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,440
Commoner! Commoner!

300
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:17,280
Open your eyes now!

301
00:16:17,980 --> 00:16:18,810
Commoner!

302
00:16:18,893 --> 00:16:19,820
Wake up!

303
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:27,560
Step aside, Claire. I'll heal her.

304
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:30,500
Please, sister.

305
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:36,157
She's going to be all right.

306
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,157
There's no need to worry.

307
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:39,237
It wasn't necessary to go that far!

308
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:41,117
Your standard magic and spellbreaker would

309
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:42,637
have been more than
enough to win the duel,

310
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:44,337
but you just had to keep pushing!

311
00:16:44,420 --> 00:16:46,197
What if the worst had happened?

312
00:16:46,280 --> 00:16:47,809
You could have killed her!

313
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:49,588
There was always a barrier.

314
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:52,998
Even Dominator couldn't have
inflicted lethal damage.

315
00:16:53,260 --> 00:16:56,497
Although, I have to admit it was
more powerful than I thought.

316
00:16:56,580 --> 00:16:59,277
Ray must have quite a bit of
magic if it hurt her that much.

317
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:00,780
How can you be so calm?

318
00:17:08,100 --> 00:17:11,520
You worry about her a
lot, don't you, Claire?

319
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,920
Miss Claire.

320
00:17:22,660 --> 00:17:24,040
Thank goodness.

321
00:17:24,820 --> 00:17:26,260
Did I win?

322
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:29,080
Unfortunately, you lost.

323
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:33,837
That's right.

324
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,380
I remember now.

325
00:17:36,780 --> 00:17:41,120
I knew that Princess Manaria had
the ability to use Dominator.

326
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:45,460
I know everything about
the world of this game.

327
00:17:45,940 --> 00:17:48,457
And because of that...

328
00:17:48,540 --> 00:17:50,120
A deal is a deal.

329
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:53,327
You've been defeated,
and now Claire is mine.

330
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:56,900
I know.

331
00:17:58,160 --> 00:18:00,000
I can never beat her.

332
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:15,920
Thank you.

333
00:18:44,300 --> 00:18:47,100
Thank you.

334
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:05,397
Come back.

335
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:07,037
I was talking to you.

336
00:20:07,120 --> 00:20:09,177
Just leave her be for now.

337
00:20:09,260 --> 00:20:10,897
She's fine. Foolish girl.

338
00:20:10,980 --> 00:20:13,457
We were instructed to
form teams for a reason.

339
00:20:13,540 --> 00:20:14,477
It's dangerous.

340
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:17,420
Ray will be perfectly safe on her own.

341
00:20:18,660 --> 00:20:19,877
Nothing's going to happen.

342
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:20,790
I promise.

343
00:20:34,940 --> 00:20:37,597
You left my side without
so much as a word.

344
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:38,817
Miss Claire.

345
00:20:38,900 --> 00:20:41,837
A servant should never abandon her master.

346
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:42,750
Besides.

347
00:20:42,833 --> 00:20:46,557
Wandering off by yourself when you haven't
gotten your full strength back yet.

348
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:48,360
It's rash and irresponsible.

349
00:20:49,460 --> 00:20:50,920
I don't see the problem.

350
00:20:51,260 --> 00:20:53,497
You have Princess Manaria, don't you?

351
00:20:53,580 --> 00:20:55,840
The world's one and only quadcaster.

352
00:20:56,340 --> 00:20:59,497
With her to protect you, you
should be perfectly safe.

353
00:20:59,580 --> 00:21:01,874
My safety isn't what I'm talking about!

354
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:07,217
Something has been bothering you, and ever
since the duel, it's only gotten worse.

355
00:21:07,300 --> 00:21:09,120
I'm fine. Nothing's wrong.

356
00:21:09,280 --> 00:21:10,340
Don't lie to me!

357
00:21:10,700 --> 00:21:13,935
The way you're acting, even
Raylaire won't go near you.

358
00:21:14,920 --> 00:21:15,940
You're quiet.

359
00:21:16,260 --> 00:21:17,848
So quiet, it's frightening.

360
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:24,228
You want to know the truth?

361
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:27,694
We fought that duel with you
as the stakes, Miss Claire.

362
00:21:30,600 --> 00:21:31,557
I lost it.

363
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:32,680
And you too.

364
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:36,099
I don't have the right to
stay by your side anymore.

365
00:21:36,940 --> 00:21:40,277
Of all the ridiculous,
you were fighting over me?

366
00:21:40,360 --> 00:21:42,640
I am not something to be one!

367
00:21:42,840 --> 00:21:43,940
How dare you two!

368
00:21:44,880 --> 00:21:46,197
Come on, be honest.

369
00:21:46,280 --> 00:21:48,480
It makes you feel good, doesn't it?

370
00:21:50,120 --> 00:21:53,617
Being wanted by someone as
amazing as Princess Manaria?

371
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:56,420
She was your first love,
right? Your prince.

372
00:21:57,240 --> 00:21:58,760
I am your master.

373
00:21:59,140 --> 00:22:00,380
You're my maid.

374
00:22:00,820 --> 00:22:02,120
Kindly act like it!

375
00:22:02,840 --> 00:22:07,546
You're sulking like a child, running from
everything because you lost one match?

376
00:22:08,040 --> 00:22:08,870
Unbelievable.

377
00:22:09,140 --> 00:22:10,697
You should be ashamed of yourself.

378
00:22:10,780 --> 00:22:12,340
I'm ashamed of you.

379
00:22:13,600 --> 00:22:14,500
In fact,

380
00:22:14,740 --> 00:22:20,320
if you continue to behave like this, then
you will no longer be fit to serve me.

381
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:25,560
That works out well, because I quit.

382
00:22:26,040 --> 00:22:27,480
What did you just say?

383
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:29,581
I'm quitting my job as your maid.

384
00:22:30,520 --> 00:22:32,760
Don't tell me you actually mean that.

385
00:22:37,020 --> 00:22:37,880
I see.

386
00:22:39,360 --> 00:22:40,500
Very well, then.

387
00:22:42,100 --> 00:22:46,760
I may have had a few complaints,
but you have served me competently.

388
00:22:47,780 --> 00:22:51,015
On behalf of the Francois
family, I offer my gratitude.

389
00:22:53,540 --> 00:22:55,480
Please accept, Miss Taylor.

390
00:23:01,380 --> 00:23:02,257
Ms. Clare!

391
00:23:02,340 --> 00:23:04,222
There's nothing keeping you now.

392
00:23:05,400 --> 00:23:08,929
I apologize for all of the
selfish demands I've made of you.

393
00:23:09,280 --> 00:23:12,500
Whatever your future holds,
I pray you find happiness.

394
00:23:16,260 --> 00:23:18,320
I've made a mistake, haven't I?

395
00:23:22,620 --> 00:23:23,960
I'll be going then.

396
00:23:26,820 --> 00:23:28,340
A fatal mistake.

397
00:23:29,280 --> 00:23:31,200
One that I can't take back.

398
00:23:36,440 --> 00:23:37,940
I'm not surprised.

399
00:23:38,300 --> 00:23:41,241
You're leaving just like
everyone else in my life.

400
00:23:45,080 --> 00:23:46,240
You liar.

401
00:23:59,280 --> 00:24:00,320
You
